---
const resources = [
  '/images/recurso-7.webp',
  '/images/recurso-6.webp',
  '/images/recurso-5.webp',
  '/images/recurso-4.webp',
  '/images/recurso-3.webp',
  '/images/recurso-2.webp',
  '/images/recurso-1.webp'
];
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white py-18 sm:py-22">
  <div class="shell relative">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.8fr]">
      <div>
        <span class="section-kicker text-slate-700">SATA Spray Gun</span>
        <h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-slate-950">Have you seen the SATAjet X 5500?</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Engineered for professionals.</p>
        <p class="section-copy mt-4 text-slate-600">
          With the X-nozzle system, painters are prepared for all paint systems and application recommendations.
          The quiet nozzle significantly reduces noise and provides a smoother, more comfortable spray feel while reducing material consumption.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-3 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-7">
          {
            resources.map((resource, index) => (
              <div class="surface-card-soft flex aspect-square items-center justify-center p-3">
                <img src={resource} alt={`SATA resource ${index + 1}`} class="h-12 w-12 object-contain" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href="#product-line" class="btn-primary">I want to learn more</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute inset-6 rounded-[32px] bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,rgba(96,165,250,0.16),transparent_60%)] blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="surface-panel relative p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="rounded-[24px] border border-sky-100 bg-white px-6 py-4">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-sky-700">X Nozzle</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
              Lower noise and a smoother spray experience for better comfort and control.
            </p>
          </div>
          <img
            src="/images/satajet-x5500.webp"
            alt="SATAjet X 5500"
            class="mx-auto mt-6 max-h-[620px] w-full object-contain"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
